        "statement": "Map panel shares exactly the captured shared TrackInfo.id via existing LayerUtil GPX exporter. Exact current Activity/view/selection/normal-mode guards reject stale launch. List multiselect, recorder state, shared DB/sent IDs, point order/segments, FileProvider roots/MIME/read grants stay owned by existing producers. XML-valid metadata round-trips exactly; path separators do not escape export cache. Unscaled action columns adapt by available/48dp; header/outer short-window fitting/native recipient acceptance are separate.",
